{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16960","headline":"同幕中诸公送李侍御归朝 · 武元衡","name":"同幕中诸公送李侍御归朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年专席奉清朝，今日持书即旧僚。\n珠履会中箫管思，白云归处帝乡遥。\n巴江暮雨连三峡，剑壁危梁上九霄。\n岁月不堪相送尽，颓颜更被别离凋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16960.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16960","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}